  "description": "Microchip MCP73831 single-cell Li-ion / Li-polymer linear charge controller in the 5-lead SOT-23: 3.75-6 V input, constant-current / constant-voltage charge to 4.20 V (±0.75 %), 15-500 mA set by one resistor on PROG, options AC (10 % preconditioning, 7.5 % termination, recharge at 96.5 % of VREG), tri-state charge status output, integrated pass transistor, reverse discharge protection, thermal regulation.",
